  "entity": "HCMv3.PerformanceManagement.PAPlan",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>One KPI line of the plan on a PA Form: the KPI, its weight and target, the ratings from the appraisee and the appraiser, and their comments. Part of the older period-based appraisal form (PA Form).</p><p>Stored for the appraisal record; no score is worked out from these lines at present. Each KPI can appear once per form.</p>",
